AMORCE - 3 steps to a self-running box
=======================================

Prereq on the key root: <latest>.dpk (+ .sha256) and deploy.sh

1) INSTALL (from adb shell, as root):
     sh /mnt/media_rw/*/deploy.sh INSTALL
   -> auto-installs from the dpk, copies the web panel + INSTALLER.sh,
      poses the boot hook, then prints the NEXT STEPS checklist.
   (richer alternative once present on the key: sh /mnt/media_rw/*/INSTALLER.sh)

2) CHECK - follow the printed PROCHAINES ETAPES checklist:
     config CHECK     nreg     manage
     browser: http://<ip-box>:8000/          (6 pages, green badges)

3) REBOOT:
     wait 4-6 min -> panel comes back ALONE.
     Memory profile, network, clock, web stack restart by themselves.

Full procedure on the key : docs/STARTUP.md
Panel guide               : docs/IHM.md
